WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:05.714
No one here

00:00:05.714 --> 00:00:07.674
is not a dreamer. 

00:00:10.468 --> 00:00:12.721
Not in a world 
like this,

00:00:12.721 --> 00:00:14.514
where you can 
have it all. 

00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:17.183
 We live with miracles 
at our fingertips. 

00:00:17.851 --> 00:00:20.061
We got robots taking 
out the trash. 

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:21.521
We fly to the stars. 

00:00:22.272 --> 00:00:23.565
And that's 
what I want

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:24.441
for you

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:25.358
and your families.

00:00:25.358 --> 00:00:27.736
That's the dream 
you all deserve. 

00:00:30.113 --> 00:00:31.656
Soon you folks 
will be saying,

00:00:32.157 --> 00:00:33.158
"Wow!"

00:00:34.409 --> 00:00:37.579
I love living 
on the moon. 

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:40.498
♫ Fly me to the moon ♫

00:00:40.498 --> 00:00:42.000
Remember we're 
not just selling. 

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:42.792
 We're changing lives. 

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:43.877
Congratulations!

00:00:43.877 --> 00:00:45.754
On your new home
 in the stars.

00:00:45.754 --> 00:00:48.256
I’ve been thinking about 
moving up there.

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:49.674
The moon might 
be nice. 

00:00:50.800 --> 00:00:52.093
What about all 
them aliens?

00:00:52.093 --> 00:00:52.761
Well, 

00:00:53.845 --> 00:00:54.763
there's no 
such thing. 

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:57.223
♫ Jupiter and Mars ♫

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:03.146
What is this? 
What's going on?

00:01:03.146 --> 00:01:04.689
Did we do 
something wrong?

00:01:04.689 --> 00:01:06.900
♫ Fly me to the moon ♫

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:07.817
I'm going to
tell him soon. 

00:01:07.817 --> 00:01:08.735
What do you 
think I am?

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:09.778
I know what you are. 

00:01:09.778 --> 00:01:11.237
You're going to 
rip him away

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:12.697
from everything 
decent. 

00:01:13.698 --> 00:01:15.200
Everyone else plays 
fast and loose. 

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:15.992
Why can't we?

00:01:15.992 --> 00:01:16.785
What?

00:01:16.785 --> 00:01:21.247
♫ Jupiter and Mars
In other words... ♫

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.749
The music can't stop. 

00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:24.459
Because we get 
to dream 

00:01:24.459 --> 00:01:25.668
on a better 
tomorrow. 

00:01:25.668 --> 00:01:27.086
♫ ...hold my hand... ♫

00:01:27.086 --> 00:01:28.713
I left my whole
 life for this. 

00:01:29.881 --> 00:01:31.508
I want the truth.

00:01:32.884 --> 00:01:35.261
♫...in other words... ♫

00:01:36.012 --> 00:01:36.846
What are we 
selling here?

00:01:36.846 --> 00:01:38.681
♫...in other words... ♫

00:01:38.681 --> 00:01:40.391
I can't fix 
our problems. 

00:01:41.059 --> 00:01:43.561
♫...in other words... ♫

00:01:43.561 --> 00:01:44.187
We'll find a way. 

00:01:44.187 --> 00:01:45.522
You and me. 

00:01:48.483 --> 00:01:50.777
There are some things 
you should know

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:52.070
about Jack. 

00:01:52.654 --> 00:01:54.489
And your brighter 
tomorrow 

00:01:54.489 --> 00:01:56.241
doesn't start when you 
land on the moon. 

00:01:56.616 --> 00:01:58.076
It starts today!

00:01:58.076 --> 00:02:01.830
♫ To the moon ♫

